  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28ec8b4c43df9884dab1e56106bf74dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Run1_Bhide_FinalLore
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Player
    text: Go on, then, tell me what am I doing here, actually, tell me what AM I.
  - speakerName: Bhide
    text: "Man how does C1 manage to conjure every vessel a dumber variation of the
      previous one\u2026."
  - speakerName: Player
    text: That. That right there. Vessel. What do you mean vessel? What am I?
  - speakerName: Bhide
    text: "Basically, you\u2019re a fighter for C1 as he is too weak to fight on
      his own\u2026But at one time, He was the most powerful being to be known. He
      held this world together for atleast a couple of centuries. He was the Greatest
      Caretaker among them."
  - speakerName: Player
    text: What is a Caretaker-
  - speakerName: C1
    text: WHAT ARE YOU STILL DOING HERE? GET OUT THERE AND GET KILLING!
  - speakerName: Bhide
    text: You better get going
